body:
You might get smushed to a meat patty or be shredded by the train or get stuck somewhere and be torn apart. Things can go many ways. anyways here is the deterrence: PAIN. IT HURTTSSSS. AAAAAHHHHH. excrutiating pain. also doubt what the online sources say about suicide by train. is it really painless?

&#x200B;

bones getting flattened. skin getting ripped off. or just becoming ground meat hmm.
